   "$=\\frac{10^7}{0.57\\times10^{-2}\\times10^{-2}}$",
   "$=\\frac1{0.57}\\times10^{11}$",
   "**$=1.75\\times10^{11}$ कूलॉम/किग्रा**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "15",
